    "proximate_text": "The cause of the increasing level trend in the 3A S/G was seat leakage past the 3A S/G main feedwater regulating valve FCV-3-478 and upstream isolation valve MOV-3-1407. The plug, seat adapter, and seals were found degraded, consistent with extended service wear... the frequency for FCV-3-478 had been one-time extended to a 5th outage the previous cycle.",
